libmonome
------------------------------------------
libmonome is a library for easy interaction with monome devices. It currently
runs on Linux (on which it is primarily developed), OpenBSD, and Darwin/OS X.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  liblo-devel-0.36-1bl1
  liblo7-0.36-1bl1
  libmonome-devel-1.4.11-1bl1
  libmonome1-1.4.11-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  liblo-devel-0.36-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/monome/libmonome

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/monome/libmonome/archive/refs/tags/v1.4.11.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libmonome-1.4.11-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libmonome-1.4.11-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libmonome-1.4.11-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmonome-1.4.11-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmonome1-1.4.11-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmonome-devel-1.4.11-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libmonome)
  /usr/bin/monomeserial.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libmonome.README
  /usr/share/doc/libmonome/COPYRIGHT
  /usr/share/doc/libmonome/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/monomeserial.1.gz

(libmonome1)
  /usr/bin/cygmonome-1.dll

(libmonome-devel)
  /usr/include/monome.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/libmonome/libmonomeConfig-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/libmonome/libmonomeConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/libmonome.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libmonome.pc

